OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer devotes 50 years to
OL,4,AUkrainian community
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who has spent 50 years serving
OL,7,Fthe Ukrainian community and helping
OL,8,Frefugees has been nominated as finalist
OL,9,Ffor a BBC Make a Difference Award.
OL,11,FPeter Luczka, whose parents came to the
OL,12,FUK as refugees after World War Two, has
OL,13,Fbeen at the heart of the Ukrainian
OL,14,Fcommunity in Coventry and Warwickshire,
OL,15,Fdedicating his time to supporting
OL,16,Fothers and helping community
OL,17,Forganisations thrive.
OL,19,FSince the Ukraine war, his focus has
OL,20,Fbeen on welcoming Ukrainian refugees,
OL,21,F"helping them feel at home and part of
OL,22,Fthe community", Lucska said.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
