OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer devotes 50 years to
OL,4,AUkrainian community
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There are days when I think, 'Do I
OL,7,Freally need to do this anymore?' but I
OL,8,Fam always looking for the next project
OL,9,Fthat will benefit the community," he
OL,10,Fadded.
